    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:d1bf136a4a3c936a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "1871ad5f99d6979ec46ac0620773827fd0bdeae6e5282c2c5c39a50ac5cf0eb8",
      "text": "Spend half a day on the Brazilian side of the falls, where you’ll get a sweeping view of the whole waterfall system. Follow the park’s walkways for views of the Floriano, Deodoro and Benjamin Constant falls and the Devil’s Throat.\n\n**Iguaçu Bird Park**\n\nAn optional visit to the Bird Park costs $50 per person.\n\n**Helicopter flight over Iguaçu Falls**\n\nYou can also take an optional helicopter flight over the falls for $170 per person.",
